---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import developerLogo from "../assets/img/developers/logo-completo-negro.png";
---

<footer class="footer-light relative overflow-hidden bg-white border-t border-slate-200" role="contentinfo">

  <svg class="footer-brand-shape absolute" viewBox="70 -5 135 163" aria-hidden="true">
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id="footerBrandGrad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
        <stop offset="0" stop-color="#00132b" />
        <stop offset=".2" stop-color="#722CCE" />
        <stop offset=".4" stop-color="#81c1d6" />
        <stop offset=".6" stop-color="#7abf72" />
        <stop offset=".8" stop-color="#efc747" />
        <stop offset="1" stop-color="#d58b3b" />
      </linearGradient>
    </defs>
    <path
      d="M116.33,46.53c-15.94,10.24-28.73,29.56-29.34,48.05-.32,8.32,2.23,19.12,11.82,20.57,9.57,1.09,17.09-8.34,21-16.14,5.52-12.43,6.96-27.35,15.26-38.85,8.48-11.85,19.69-23.74,35.5-23.79,19.15-.37,28.32,17.42,26.12,34.62-1.59,15.05-7.81,28.61-15.51,41.33-8.17,13.26-18.06,24.33-30.43,34.33-5.02,4.61-12.96,4.14-17.25-1.19-5.71-6.67-1.55-17.67,7.03-19.04,9.13-1.66,17.71-7.05,24.54-13.48,11.65-11.11,19.66-27.12,20.81-42.84.41-6.21-.3-12.36-2.84-16.98-5.51-10.07-21.53-12.47-31.06-5.51-5.51,3.95-10.47,8.72-14.15,14.39-8.03,11.65-8.5,25.88-14.26,38.78-4.81,9.79-13.07,20.8-25.29,20.48-13.59-.74-19.74-14.23-20.37-26.26-1.56-15.14,3.85-30.25,10.98-43.26,3.49-6.6,7.21-12.99,10.28-20.07,2.62-6.03,9.64-8.79,15.67-6.16,8.74,3.59,9.57,16.3,1.51,21.04h0Z"
      fill="url(#footerBrandGrad)"
    />
  </svg>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 pt-16 pb-8 relative z-10">

    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-x-10 gap-y-12 pb-12">

      <div class="lg:col-span-4">
        <a href="/" class="inline-block mb-5" aria-label="Inicio">
          <img src="/assets/logos/logo1.png" alt="FINTEGRAR" class="footer-brand-logo h-12 w-auto" />
        </a>
        <p class="footer-tagline max-w-xs mb-6">
          36 años promoviendo el bienestar de nuestros asociados. Somos un Fondo de Empleados sin ánimo de lucro, legalmente constituido y vigilado por la Superintendencia de la Economía Solidaria.
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <a href="https://www.facebook.com/p/Fintegrar-Fondo-de-Empleados-61579258882412/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="footer-social" aria-label="Facebook">
            <Icon name="tabler:brand-facebook" class="w-4.5 h-4.5" />
          </a>
          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/fintegrar_/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="footer-social" aria-label="Instagram">
            <Icon name="tabler:brand-instagram" class="w-4.5 h-4.5" />
          </a>
          <a href="https://api.whatsapp.com/send/?phone=573174879669&text=Hola%2C+quisiera+informaci%C3%B3n+sobre+cr%C3%A9dito%2Fcartera.&type=phone_number&app_absent=0" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="footer-social" aria-label="WhatsApp">
            <Icon name="tabler:brand-whatsapp" class="w-4.5 h-4.5" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-2">
        <h3 class="footer-heading">Contacto</h3>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
          <li>
            <a href="mailto:gerencia@fintegrar.com" class="footer-link inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
              gerencia@fintegrar.com
              <Icon name="tabler:arrow-up-right" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="tel:+573174879669" class="footer-link">317 487 9669</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="footer-link footer-link--static">Oficinas de Prosalco IPS Poblado, Cra 43 A # 25-69</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-2">
        <h3 class="footer-heading">Institución</h3>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
          <li><a href="/nosotros" class="footer-link">Quiénes somos</a></li>
          <li><a href="/cuerpos-colegiados" class="footer-link">C. de Administración</a></li>
          <li><a href="/cuerpos-colegiados#junta" class="footer-link">Junta de Vigilancia</a></li>
          <li><a href="/normatividad#informes" class="footer-link">Informe de Gestión</a></li>
          <li><a href="/normatividad" class="footer-link">Normatividad</a></li>
          <li><a href="/normatividad#sarlaft" class="footer-link">SARLAFT</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-2">
        <h3 class="footer-heading">Servicios</h3>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
          <li><a href="/ahorros" class="footer-link">Modalidades de ahorro</a></li>
          <li><a href="/creditos" class="footer-link">Líneas de crédito</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ahorros#rifa-semanal" class="footer-link">Rifa Semanal</a></li>
          <li><a href="/convenios" class="footer-link">Convenios</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-2">
        <h3 class="footer-heading">Accesos Directos</h3>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
          <li>
            <a href="https://tramitesvirtuales.fintegrar.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="footer-link inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
              Trámites Virtuales
              <Icon name="tabler:arrow-up-right" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://www.zonapagos.net/formulariosNV/?cod=BTK3a53qAPJK5dFzuUb9xoOMEi6GjxTVEz6jgj8WOG4kf7Z7mmbU2N6iG2sClbz5isF7xpuvz4ec%2FstAKWghYq2ihH6ea5Ab%2BfJXSgfBIPShwQxb9hHbzgY1XqGlsllif2sqgYeyszPfE%2Fq5SNonDhF9ZhqXm7OyDm%2Ba4lfdMItrvmOCQ5Py2gAq%2BvwFtoRMoNDPxeZKzglBDlEyqykoMK2kz6zyhc7dmjJO23oOZfDrWY5p5hfLu%2BH0xUIIx2%2F2zJLthSgc28WEY9rneC44s4DORf3zdoMntL1Bmxpscus%3D" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="footer-link inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
              Pague en línea (PSE)
              <Icon name="tabler:arrow-up-right" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
            </a>
          </li>
          <li><a href="/directorio" class="footer-link">Directorio</a></li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="footer-heading mt-8">Legales</h3>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
          <li><a href="/aviso-privacidad" class="footer-link">Privacidad</a></li>
          <li><a href="/politica-tratamiento-datos" class="footer-link">Políticas de Tratamiento</a></li>
          <li><a href="/terminos-condiciones" class="footer-link">Términos y Condiciones</a></li>
          <li><a href="/pqrsf" class="footer-link">Radicar PQRSF</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="py-8 flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8 lg:gap-6">
      <div class="footer-vigilada flex items-center gap-3 sm:gap-4 flex-shrink-0" role="note" aria-label="Vigilada por la Superintendencia de la Economía Solidaria">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-stretch gap-[3px] w-fit flex-shrink-0">
          <span class="footer-vigilada-line"></span>
          <span class="footer-vigilada-text text-center">VIGILADA</span>
          <span class="footer-vigilada-line"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-vigilada-sub flex flex-col text-left leading-tight">
          <span>SUPERINTENDENCIA DE LA</span>
          <span>ECONOMÍA SOLIDARIA</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-4">
        <h3 class="footer-heading footer-heading--plain whitespace-nowrap">Entidades aliadas</h3>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-x-8 gap-y-4">
          <img src="/assets/logos/aliadoprosalco.png" alt="Prosalco" class="footer-ally-logo" />
          <img src="/assets/logos/aliadopoliclinico.png" alt="Policlínico Sur" class="footer-ally-logo" />
          <img src="/assets/logos/alieadosumemoscoop.png" alt="Sumemos Coop" class="footer-ally-logo" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pt-6 mt-4 border-t footer-divider flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:flex-nowrap items-center justify-between gap-3 lg:gap-8 leading-tight">
      <div class="footer-fineprint text-center lg:text-left order-1 lg:order-1 lg:whitespace-nowrap">
        © 2026 Fondo de Empleados - Fintegrar. Todos los derechos reservados.
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 footer-fineprint whitespace-nowrap order-2 lg:order-2">
        Desarrollado por
        <a href="https://centratechnologiesdc.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="opacity-80 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
          <Image src={developerLogo} alt="Centra Technologies DC" class="h-4 w-auto" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .footer-light {
    background: var(--color-white, #ffffff);
  }

  .footer-brand-shape {
    top: -25%;
    bottom: -25%;
    right: -8%;
    height: 150%;
    width: auto;
    opacity: 0.08;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 639px) {
    .footer-brand-shape {
      display: none;
    }
  }

  .footer-divider {
    border-color: #e2e8f0;
  }

  .footer-brand-logo {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .footer-tagline {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: #4b5563;
  }

  .footer-social {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background: #f1f5f9;
    color: var(--color-ink, #00132b);
    transition: background 0.15s, color 0.15s;
  }

  .footer-social:hover {
    background: var(--color-brand-purple, #722cce);
    color: var(--color-white, #ffffff);
  }

  .footer-heading {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: var(--fw-bold);
    color: var(--color-ink, #00132b);
    padding-bottom: 0.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .footer-heading--plain {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: var(--fw-regular);
    padding-bottom: 0;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    border-bottom: none;
    color: #64748b;
  }

  .footer-link {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: var(--fw-regular);
    color: #4b5563;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.15s;
    width: fit-content;
  }

  .footer-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-brand-purple, #722cce);
  }

  .footer-link--static {
    color: #4b5563;
  }

  .footer-ally-logo {
    height: 32px;
    width: auto;
    max-width: 140px;
    object-fit: contain;
    opacity: 0.85;
    transition: opacity 0.15s;
  }

  .footer-ally-logo:hover {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .footer-vigilada-line {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 1.5px;
    background: var(--color-ink, #00132b);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  }

  .footer-vigilada-text {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: var(--fw-extrabold);
    color: var(--color-ink, #00132b);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .footer-vigilada-sub {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: var(--fw-semibold);
    color: #64748b;
  }

  .footer-fineprint {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: #64748b;
  }
</style>
